# Hazelknot

Handmade crochet online shop. Orders are placed through Facebook Messenger.

## Live site

https://আপনার-username.github.io/hazelknot/

## Files

- `index.html` - page structure (text and sections)
- `css/style.css` - main theme and colors
- `css/entry.css` - entry screen animation
- `js/data.js` - shop name, Messenger username, products
- `js/utils.js` - message, copy and toast helpers
- `js/entry.js` - entry screen logic
- `js/shop.js` - shop, product popup, custom order

## How to edit

- Change products, prices and the Messenger username in `js/data.js`.
- Change colors in the `:root` block at the top of `css/style.css`.
- Change the entry animation in `css/entry.css`.

## Notes

Upload all files and folders together. Opening `index.html` alone may not load the styles and scripts.